  "positiveSourceObservations": [
    "All twenty function names resolve on the six real source files; delegated task names use actual task parameters. Production source is not rewritten on disk.",
    "Declared cooperative logical-call/read/parse caps, aggregate/inflight/handle bounds and truncated checkpoint inventory are present; no claim to cap every syscall or in-flight native operation.",
    "100 and 250 remain separate assignments; 250 checks same-source/same-packet natural 100 and distinct post-controller release before installation and witness entry.",
